{"source": "kew-african", "source_id": "86894", "taxon": "Monsonia ovata Cav.", "organ": "description", "language": "en", "text": "Perennial erect herb up to 4 dm. tall, with ± woody basal region and thick fleshy roots; stems woody with annual leafy branches; internodes 0.1–3(–5) cm. long; vegetative parts, peduncles, pedicels, and sepals pubescent, ± covered with short recurved or patent and often gland-tipped hairs and with long patent hairs also present. Leaves opposite to subopposite (almost alternate), or just in a bunch of indistinct phyllotaxy especially on the annual shoots; lamina narrowly lanceolate to ovate, 1–4.5 cm. long, 0.3–2.3 cm. wide, acute to subacute at the apex, margin serrate to crenate, the base cordate to subcordate, tomentose; petiole 1–2 cm. long, densely pubescent with short and long as well as glandular hairs; stipules acicular to spiny, 5–12(–14) mm. long. Inflorescence usually of 2 flowers; peduncles 1.5–9 cm. long, leaf-opposed or in the axil of the smaller of the 2 apparently opposite leaves; pedicel (l–)2.5–5(–7) cm. long; bracts 2–6 per pedicel, filiform to linear, 5–12 mm. long. Sepals narrowly oblong to lanceolate, with an acicular 1–5 mm. long apical appendage, 7–12 mm. long, 3–4 mm. wide. Petals obovate, (11–)14–22.5 mm. long, 6–14(–17) mm. wide, truncate at the apex, white, cream or yellowish. Stamens yellow; filaments 7–9.5 mm. long, pubescent; anthers 2–2.5 mm. long, 1–1.5 mm. wide. Extrastaminal glands inconspicuous ovate cavities with sometimes only the 2 lateral rims visible. Ovary tomentose; stigmas clavate, 1.5–2.5 mm. long. Fruit 5.5–10 cm. long; mericarps 12.5–13.5 mm. long, 2–2.6 mm. wide. Seeds 6–6.5 mm. long, 2–2.4 mm. wide; testa minutely reticulate, pale brown.", "assertions": [{"po_id": "PO_0000003", "pato_id": "PATO_0000622", "po_label": "whole plant", "pato_label": "erect", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "Perennial erect herb"}, {"po_id": "PO_0000003", "pato_id": "PATO_0000119", "po_label": "whole plant", "pato_label": "height", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": 4.0, "unit": "dm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "up to 4 dm. tall"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020127", "pato_id": "PATO_0000591", "po_label": "primary root", "pato_label": "increased thickness", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "fleshy", "modifier": "", "source_text": "thick fleshy roots"}, {"po_id": "PO_0005005", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "shoot internode", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": 0.1, "value_high": 3.0, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "internodes 0.1–3(–5) cm. long"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009025", "pato_id": "PATO_0001877", "po_label": "vascular leaf", "pato_label": "lanceolate", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "lamina narrowly lanceolate to ovate"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009025", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "vascular leaf", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": 1.0, "value_high": 4.5, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "1–4.5 cm. long"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009025", "pato_id": "PATO_0000921", "po_label": "vascular leaf", "pato_label": "width", "negated": false, "value_low": 0.3, "value_high": 2.3, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "0.3–2.3 cm. wide"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009025", "pato_id": "PATO_0000389", "po_label": "vascular leaf", "pato_label": "acute", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "apex", "modifier": "", "source_text": "acute to subacute at the apex"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009025", "pato_id": "PATO_0001206", "po_label": "vascular leaf", "pato_label": "serrated", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "margin", "modifier": "", 